        "liquid": "<div class=\"trustpilot-clean\">\n  <h2>They stopped thinking<br>about what to wear.</h2>\n  <div class=\"trustpilot-line\">\n    <span class=\"rating-text\">Excellent</span>\n    <strong class=\"rating-score\">4.8 / 5</strong>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0891/4871/9429/files/stars-4.5-trust-pilot.svg?v=1747080316\" alt=\"4.8 stars\" class=\"stars-img\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"trustpilot-bottom\">\n    <span>Based on <strong>+4 300</strong> reviews</span>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0891/4871/9429/files/trustpilot-svg_klyne.webp?v=1743809609\" alt=\"Trustpilot\" class=\"tp-logo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"video-proof-section\">\n  <p class=\"video-proof-subtitle\"></p>\n  <div class=\"video-proof-wrapper\">\n    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=\"auto\" class=\"video-proof-player\">\n      <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/6e839f9c6c8b4916a098ae131f4096f3.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    </video>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"video-proof-badge\">\n    <span>✦ 4,300+ women never went back to real clothes</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.trustpilot-clean {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #000;\n  margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n  padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n}\n.trustpilot-clean h2 {\n  font-size: 25px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-top: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.8rem;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.trustpilot-line {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n.rating-text,\n.rating-score {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  line-height: 1;\n  display: inline-block;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  margin-top: 1px;\n}\n.rating-score {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.stars-img {\n  width: 120px;\n  margin-right: 10px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.trustpilot-bottom {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n.tp-logo {\n  height: 24px;\n  margin-top: -2px;\n}\n.video-proof-section {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 3rem 1rem;\n  background-color: #fdf8f4;\n}\n.video-proof-subtitle {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: #888;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n}\n.video-proof-wrapper {\n  max-width: 480px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  overflow: hidden;\nrgba(0,0,0,0.10);\n  background: #000;\n  aspect-ratio: 9/16;\n  position: relative;\n}\n.video-proof-player {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  display: block;\n}\n.video-proof-badge {\n  margin-top: 1.4rem;\n  margin-bottom: -10.4rem;\n  display: inline-block;\n  background-color: #C4614A;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 0.25rem 1.2rem;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n}\n</style>",
