        "liquid_mBYb9R": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n  ELORYA · BLOC 3 — Pilules de confiance + paiements\n                    + timeline de livraison + carrousel d'avis\n  Placement : section \"Información del producto\",\n              bloc Liquid personalizado JUSTE SOUS \"Añadir al carrito\".\n  Dépendances : aucune. (Le bloc de tokens Elorya est optionnel.)\n  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely3' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ───────────── RÉGLAGES ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign ely_t1 = 'Envío Gratis'     -%}\n{%- assign ely_t2 = 'Soporte 24/7'     -%}\n{%- assign ely_t3 = 'Garantía 30 días' -%}\n\n{%- assign ely_pay_img = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/Frame_1000003454-1_png_430x.avif?v=1785817587' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} Délais : x = aujourd'hui · envoi x+1→x+2 · livraison x+5→x+7 {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign ship_min = 1 -%}{%- assign ship_max = 2 -%}\n{%- assign deli_min = 5 -%}{%- assign deli_max = 7 -%}\n\n{%- assign rev1_img  = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/e8c649eb8ae04223aaed75d4d3a74e75_430x.jpg?v=1786462812' -%}\n{%- assign rev1_text = 'Sujeción perfecta y muy cómoda.' -%}\n{%- assign rev1_name = 'Laura M.' -%}\n\n{%- assign rev2_img  = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/56aee308-33d5-43ed-af93-8882c72d8a76_430x.jpg?v=1786462812' -%}\n{%- assign rev2_text = 'No se mueve en todo el día.' -%}\n{%- assign rev2_name = 'María G.' -%}\n\n{%- assign rev3_img  = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0795/2754/3033/files/e-x-t-e-r-n-a-l_-i-m-a-g-e_-t-o_-i-m-a-g-e-dfac53e6-8ab9-4401-8ffb-e7ef0b290184_430x.jpg?v=1786462813' -%}\n{%- assign rev3_text = 'Realza el busto y queda totalmente invisible.' -%}\n{%- assign rev3_name = 'Carmen R.' -%}\n\n{%- comment -%} ───────────── DATES (rendu serveur, réécrites par le JS) ───────────── {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign meses = \"Enero,Febrero,Marzo,Abril,Mayo,Junio,Julio,Agosto,Septiembre,Octubre,Noviembre,Diciembre\" | split: \",\" -%}\n{%- assign day    = 86400 -%}\n{%- assign t0     = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}\n{%- assign ship_a = ship_min | times: day | plus: t0 -%}\n{%- assign ship_b = ship_max | times: day | plus: t0 -%}\n{%- assign deli_a = deli_min | times: day | plus: t0 -%}\n{%- assign deli_b = deli_max | times: day | plus: t0 -%}\n{%- assign m0 = t0     | date: '%-m' | minus: 1 -%}\n{%- assign ma = ship_a | date: '%-m' | minus: 1 -%}\n{%- assign mb = ship_b | date: '%-m' | minus: 1 -%}\n{%- assign mc = deli_a | date: '%-m' | minus: 1 -%}\n{%- assign md = deli_b | date: '%-m' | minus: 1 -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-b3{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));color:#1A1A1A;}\n  .ely-b3 *,.ely-b3 *::before,.ely-b3 *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  /* ── 1. Pilules de confiance ── */\n  .ely-b3 .ely-trust{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:4px;margin:16px 0;flex-wrap:nowrap;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-trust__item{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:#222;border:1.5px solid #D0D0D0;\n    border-radius:20px;padding:5px 9px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;white-space:nowrap;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-trust__item svg{width:13px;height:13px;flex:0 0 13px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;\n    stroke-width:1.9;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;display:block;}\n\n  /* ── 2. Badges de paiement ── */\n  .ely-b3 .ely-pay{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:14px 0 22px;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-pay img{width:100%;max-width:330px;height:auto;display:block;}\n\n  /* ── 3. Timeline de livraison ── */\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid #E6E6E6;\n    border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 26px;background:#fff;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__col{position:relative;padding:20px 10px 18px;text-align:center;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__col + .ely-ship__col{border-left:1px solid #E6E6E6;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__col + .ely-ship__col::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-7px;top:50%;\n    width:12px;height:12px;margin-top:-6px;background:#fff;\n    border-top:1.5px solid #D8D8D8;border-right:1.5px solid #D8D8D8;transform:rotate(45deg);}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:#111;margin:0 auto 14px;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__icon svg{width:24px;height:24px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;\n    stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;display:block;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;margin:0 0 6px;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-ship__date{font-size:14px;line-height:1.3;margin:0;}\n\n  /* ── 4. Carrousel d'avis ── */\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__track{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__slide{flex:0 0 100%;scroll-snap-align:center;display:flex;align-items:center;\n    gap:18px;padding:4px 2px;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__ph{width:62px;height:62px;flex:0 0 62px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__body{min-width:0;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__text{font-size:16px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 10px;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__name{font-size:15px;color:#9B9B9B;margin:0;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__dots{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:16px 0 4px;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#C9C9C9;border:none;padding:0;\n    cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}\n  .ely-b3 .ely-rev__dot[aria-current=\"true\"]{width:13px;height:13px;background:#1A1A1A;\n    box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #fff,0 0 0 6.5px #C9C9C9;}\n\n  /* ── Petits écrans ── */\n  @media(max-width:380px){\n    .ely-b3 .ely-trust{gap:3px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-trust__item{font-size:9.5px;padding:5px 7px;gap:3px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-trust__item svg{width:11px;height:11px;flex:0 0 11px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-ship__col{padding:16px 6px 14px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-ship__icon{width:40px;height:40px;margin-bottom:10px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-ship__icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-ship__title{font-size:13.5px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-ship__date{font-size:12.5px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-rev__ph{width:54px;height:54px;flex:0 0 54px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-rev__text{font-size:14.5px;}\n    .ely-b3 .ely-rev__name{font-size:13.5px;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-b3\" id=\"ely-b3-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <!-- 1 ─ Pilules -->\n  <div class=\"ely-trust\">\n    <div class=\"ely-trust__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.5 13.5 3 11l18-7-7 18-2.5-7.5Z\"/><path d=\"m10.5 13.5 4-4\"/></svg>\n      {{ ely_t1 }}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ely-trust__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14v-2a8 8 0 0 1 16 0v2\"/><path d=\"M4 14h2.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V14Z\"/><path d=\"M20 14h-2.5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1H19a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V14Z\"/></svg>\n      {{ ely_t2 }}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ely-trust__item\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 2.6-6.4\"/><path d=\"M3 4v5h5\"/></svg>\n      {{ ely_t3 }}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2 ─ Paiements -->\n  <div class=\"ely-pay\">\n    <img src=\"{{ ely_pay_img }}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"\n         alt=\"American Express, Maestro, Mastercard, Visa, Apple Pay, Shop Pay\">\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 3 ─ Timeline -->\n  <div class=\"ely-ship\"\n       data-ship-min=\"{{ ship_min }}\" data-ship-max=\"{{ ship_max }}\"\n       data-deli-min=\"{{ deli_min }}\" data-deli-max=\"{{ deli_max }}\">\n    <div class=\"ely-ship__col\">\n      <div class=\"ely-ship__icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/><path d=\"m10 15.5 1.5 1.5 3-3\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__title\">Pedido realizado</p>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__date\" data-ely-d0>{{ t0 | date: '%-d' }} {{ meses[m0] }}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-ship__col\">\n      <div class=\"ely-ship__icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 8h9v9H2z\"/><path d=\"M11 11h4l3 3v3h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M14 5h7M16 8h5\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__title\">enviado</p>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__date\" data-ely-d1>{{ ship_a | date: '%-d' }} {{ meses[ma] }} - {{ ship_b | date: '%-d' }} {{ meses[mb] }}</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-ship__col\">\n      <div class=\"ely-ship__icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 21s7-6.2 7-11a7 7 0 1 0-14 0c0 4.8 7 11 7 11Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__title\">Entregado</p>\n      <p class=\"ely-ship__date\" data-ely-d2>{{ deli_a | date: '%-d' }} {{ meses[mc] }} - {{ deli_b | date: '%-d' }} {{ meses[md] }}</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 4 ─ Avis -->\n  <div class=\"ely-rev\">\n    <div class=\"ely-rev__track\" data-ely-rev-track>\n      <div class=\"ely-rev__slide\">\n        <img class=\"ely-rev__ph\" src=\"{{ rev1_img }}\" alt=\"{{ rev1_name }}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <div class=\"ely-rev__body\">\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__text\">{{ rev1_text }}</p>\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__name\">{{ rev1_name }}</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ely-rev__slide\">\n        <img class=\"ely-rev__ph\" src=\"{{ rev2_img }}\" alt=\"{{ rev2_name }}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <div class=\"ely-rev__body\">\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__text\">{{ rev2_text }}</p>\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__name\">{{ rev2_name }}</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ely-rev__slide\">\n        <img class=\"ely-rev__ph\" src=\"{{ rev3_img }}\" alt=\"{{ rev3_name }}\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <div class=\"ely-rev__body\">\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__text\">{{ rev3_text }}</p>\n          <p class=\"ely-rev__name\">{{ rev3_name }}</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ely-rev__dots\" data-ely-rev-dots aria-label=\"Reseñas\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-rev__dot\" aria-current=\"true\"  aria-label=\"Reseña 1\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-rev__dot\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Reseña 2\"></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-rev__dot\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Reseña 3\"></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('ely-b3-{{ uid }}');\n  if(!root || root.dataset.elyInit) return;\n  root.dataset.elyInit = '1';\n\n  /* ── Dates : recalculées sur l'horloge du visiteur (x, x+1/x+2, x+5/x+7) ── */\n  var box = root.querySelector('.ely-ship');\n  if(box){\n    var MESES = ['Enero','Febrero','Marzo','Abril','Mayo','Junio',\n                 'Julio','Agosto','Septiembre','Octubre','Noviembre','Diciembre'];\n    var now = new Date();\n    var add = function(n){ var d = new Date(now); d.setDate(d.getDate() + n); return d; };\n    var fmt = function(d){ return d.getDate() + ' ' + MESES[d.getMonth()]; };\n    var n   = function(k){ return parseInt(box.dataset[k], 10); };\n    box.querySelector('[data-ely-d0]').textContent = fmt(now);\n    box.querySelector('[data-ely-d1]').textContent = fmt(add(n('shipMin'))) + ' - ' + fmt(add(n('shipMax')));\n    box.querySelector('[data-ely-d2]').textContent = fmt(add(n('deliMin'))) + ' - ' + fmt(add(n('deliMax')));\n  }\n\n  /* ── Carrousel d'avis ── */\n  var track = root.querySelector('[data-ely-rev-track]');\n  var dots  = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.ely-rev__dot'));\n  if(track && dots.length){\n    var slides = root.querySelectorAll('.ely-rev__slide').length;\n    var setActive = function(i){\n      dots.forEach(function(d, k){ d.setAttribute('aria-current', k === i ? 'true' : 'false'); });\n    };\n    var raf;\n    track.addEventListener('scroll', function(){\n      cancelAnimationFrame(raf);\n      raf = requestAnimationFrame(function(){\n        var i = Math.round(track.scrollLeft / track.clientWidth);\n        setActive(Math.max(0, Math.min(slides - 1, i)));\n      });\n    }, {passive:true});\n    dots.forEach(function(dot, i){\n      dot.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        track.scrollTo({ left: i * track.clientWidth, behavior:'smooth' });\n        setActive(i);\n      });\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script>{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 4A — Accordéons produit.\n  Placement : section \"Información del producto\", bloc Liquid personalizado,\n  APRÈS le carrousel d'avis / AVANT \"Ver todos los detalles\".\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely4a' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-faq{font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));\n    max-width:700px;margin:24px auto;color:#1A1A1A;}\n  .ely-faq *,.ely-faq *::before,.ely-faq *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .ely-faq__item{border-top:1px solid #E5E5E5;}\n  .ely-faq__item:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5;}\n  .ely-faq__q{width:100%;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:16px 4px;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;text-align:left;}\n  .ely-faq__chev{flex-shrink:0;transition:transform .25s ease;color:#1A1A1A;}\n  .ely-faq__item.is-open .ely-faq__chev{transform:rotate(180deg);}\n  .ely-faq__a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .3s ease;}\n  .ely-faq__inner{padding:0 4px 18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#444;}\n  .ely-faq__inner h3{font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;margin:16px 0 8px;}\n  .ely-faq__inner h3:first-child{margin-top:0;}\n  .ely-faq__inner p{margin:0 0 9px;}\n  .ely-faq__inner ul{margin:0 0 9px;padding-left:20px;}\n  .ely-faq__inner li{margin-bottom:5px;}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-faq\" id=\"ely-faq-{{ uid }}\">\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-a1-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Qué talla debo elegir?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq__chev\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq__a\" id=\"ely-a1-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq__inner\">\n        <h3>¿No sabes cuál es tu talla?</h3>\n        <p>Nuestro sujetador sin aros es muy elástico y se adapta a distintas formas de pecho, de la copa A a la E.</p>\n\n        <h3>Equivalencia rápida</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>70A–75C → S</strong></li>\n          <li><strong>75D–80C → M</strong></li>\n          <li><strong>80D–85C → L</strong></li>\n          <li><strong>85D–100E → XL</strong></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>Ejemplos prácticos</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Si usas 70B, 70C, 75A o 75C → talla <strong>S</strong></li>\n          <li>Si usas 75D, 80A, 80B o 80C → talla <strong>M</strong></li>\n          <li>Si usas 80D, 80E, 85A o 85C → talla <strong>L</strong></li>\n          <li>Si usas 85D, 90C, 95B o 100C → talla <strong>XL</strong></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>Cómo medirte</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Mide el contorno del pecho por la parte más ancha del busto.</li>\n          <li>Compara tu medida con la tabla de arriba.</li>\n          <li>¿Copa grande o prefieres ir más holgada? Sube una talla.</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h3>Si dudas entre dos tallas</h3>\n        <p>Elige siempre la mayor. Ganas comodidad y la sujeción queda igual de firme.</p>\n\n        <h3>Cambio de talla garantizado</h3>\n        <p>Si no aciertas, la cambias sin complicaciones. Escríbenos y te ayudamos a encontrar tu talla ideal.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-a2-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>Garantía de Confianza de 30 Días</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq__chev\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq__a\" id=\"ely-a2-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq__inner\">\n        <p>Pruébalo 30 días. Sin riesgo.</p>\n        <p>Si no te convence, te devolvemos el 100% de tu dinero.</p>\n        <p>Sin preguntas. Sin complicaciones.</p>\n        <p>Y además, un año de garantía de calidad.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-a3-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Sujeta realmente el pecho?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq__chev\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq__a\" id=\"ely-a3-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq__inner\">\n        <p>Sí. Su banda ancha con doble refuerzo reparte el peso en todo el contorno: sujeta de verdad, sin aros y sin apretar.</p>\n        <p>Lo notas desde el primer día: más soporte, más forma, más seguridad.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-faq__item\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-faq__q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"ely-a4-{{ uid }}\">\n      <span>¿Y si la talla no me queda bien?</span>\n      <svg class=\"ely-faq__chev\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"ely-faq__a\" id=\"ely-a4-{{ uid }}\">\n      <div class=\"ely-faq__inner\">\n        <p>No pasa nada.</p>\n        <p>Si no te queda perfecta, la cambias fácilmente.</p>\n        <p>Y si prefieres asegurarte antes de pedir, escríbenos: te decimos tu talla en un minuto.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('ely-faq-{{ uid }}');\n  if(!root || root.dataset.elyInit) return;\n  root.dataset.elyInit = '1';\n\n  var items = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.ely-faq__item'));\n\n  items.forEach(function(item){\n    var btn = item.querySelector('.ely-faq__q');\n    var ans = item.querySelector('.ely-faq__a');\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var open = item.classList.toggle('is-open');\n      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n      ans.style.maxHeight = open ? ans.scrollHeight + 'px' : null;\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Recalcule la hauteur des panneaux ouverts (rotation, redimensionnement).\n  var t;\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){\n    clearTimeout(t);\n    t = setTimeout(function(){\n      items.forEach(function(item){\n        if(item.classList.contains('is-open')){\n          var ans = item.querySelector('.ely-faq__a');\n          ans.style.maxHeight = ans.scrollHeight + 'px';\n        }\n      });\n    }, 150);\n  }, {passive:true});\n})();\n</script>\n\n{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA · BLOC 4B — \"Amado por…\" + carrousel vidéo.\n  Placement : nouvelle section \"Liquid personalizado\", JUSTE SOUS la section produit.\n{%- endcomment -%}\n{%- assign uid = block.id | default: section.id | default: 'ely4b' -%}\n\n{%- assign ely_vid_title = 'Amado por +18.000 mujeres' -%}\n{%- assign vid1 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/a3d998dddf0e4ab3831f7956978a6632.mp4' -%}\n{%- assign vid2 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/3c4885419d894550b66c97039fad5632.mp4' -%}\n{%- assign vid3 = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/0ac2128aff7643549dc00fcd01b4c30a.mp4' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .ely-vc{width:100%;overflow:hidden;margin:0;padding:0;\n    font-family:var(--ely-font,var(--elorya-font,'Barlow','Montserrat',sans-serif));}\n  .ely-vc *,.ely-vc *::before,.ely-vc *::after{box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .ely-vc__title{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(19px,5.6vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#000;\n    margin:14px 0 2px;padding:0 14px;line-height:1.25;text-wrap:balance;}\n  .ely-vc__track{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none;\n    overscroll-behavior-x:contain;touch-action:pan-x;}\n  .ely-vc__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}\n  .ely-vc__slide{position:relative;flex:0 0 auto;width:36%;aspect-ratio:9/16;scroll-snap-align:center;\n    border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;transform:translateZ(0);\n    -webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;}\n  .ely-vc__video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;cursor:pointer;background:#000;}\n  .ely-vc__btn{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);border:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    cursor:pointer;padding:0;z-index:2;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}\n  @media(min-width:768px){\n    .ely-vc__title{margin:28px 0 6px;}\n    .ely-vc__slide{width:22%;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ely-vc\" id=\"ely-vc-{{ uid }}\">\n  <h2 class=\"ely-vc__title\">{{ ely_vid_title }}</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"ely-vc__track\" data-ely-vc-track>\n    {%- assign vids = vid1 | append: '|' | append: vid2 | append: '|' | append: vid3 | split: '|' -%}\n    {%- for v in vids -%}\n      <div class=\"ely-vc__slide\" data-ely-vc-src=\"{{ v }}\">\n        <video class=\"ely-vc__video\" playsinline muted preload=\"none\"></video>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ely-vc__btn\" aria-label=\"Reproducir vídeo\">\n          <svg class=\"ely-ic-play\"  width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6,4 20,12 6,20\"/></svg>\n          <svg class=\"ely-ic-pause\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:none\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\"/><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('ely-vc-{{ uid }}');\n  if(!wrap || wrap.dataset.elyInit) return;\n  wrap.dataset.elyInit = '1';\n\n  var track  = wrap.querySelector('[data-ely-vc-track]');\n  var slides = Array.prototype.slice.call(wrap.querySelectorAll('.ely-vc__slide'));\n\n  function sync(slide){\n    var v = slide.querySelector('.ely-vc__video');\n    slide.querySelector('.ely-ic-play').style.display  = v.paused ? '' : 'none';\n    slide.querySelector('.ely-ic-pause').style.display = v.paused ? 'none' : '';\n  }\n  function pauseAll(except){\n    slides.forEach(function(s){\n      if(s !== except){\n        var v = s.querySelector('.ely-vc__video');\n        if(!v.paused){ v.pause(); sync(s); }\n      }\n    });\n  }\n  function load(slide){\n    var v = slide.querySelector('.ely-vc__video');\n    if(v.querySelector('source')) return;\n    var src = document.createElement('source');\n    src.src  = slide.getAttribute('data-ely-vc-src');\n    src.type = 'video/mp4';\n    v.appendChild(src);\n    v.load();\n  }\n\n  slides.forEach(function(slide){\n    var v   = slide.querySelector('.ely-vc__video');\n    var btn = slide.querySelector('.ely-vc__btn');\n    v.muted = true; v.volume = 0;\n\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      load(slide);\n      if(v.paused){\n        pauseAll(slide);\n        v.muted = true;\n        var p = v.play();\n        if(p && p.catch) p.catch(function(){});\n      } else { v.pause(); }\n      sync(slide);\n    });\n\n    v.addEventListener('click', function(){ btn.click(); });\n    ['play','pause','ended'].forEach(function(ev){\n      v.addEventListener(ev, function(){ sync(slide); });\n    });\n  });\n\n  // Charge la 1re frame quand la vignette entre dans le viewport, met en pause quand elle sort.\n  if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n    var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n      entries.forEach(function(en){\n        var slide = en.target, v = slide.querySelector('.ely-vc__video');\n        if(en.isIntersecting){ load(slide); }\n        else if(!v.paused){ v.pause(); sync(slide); }\n      });\n    }, { root: track, threshold: .5 });\n    slides.forEach(function(s){ obs.observe(s); });\n  } else {\n    slides.forEach(load);\n  }\n})();\n</script>"
          }
        },
        "liquid_FGMXwE": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA — FAQ accordéon + garantie\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .elo-faq{\n    --elo-text:var(--elorya-text,#14140F);\n    --elo-body:var(--elorya-body,#3A3A34);\n    --elo-line:var(--elorya-line,#E6E6E2);\n    font-family:var(--elorya-font,'Montserrat',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif);\n    color:var(--elo-body);margin:24px 0;\n  }\n  .elo-faq *{box-sizing:border-box}\n\n  .elo-faq__item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--elo-line)}\n  .elo-faq__item:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--elo-line)}\n\n  .elo-faq__q{\n    list-style:none;cursor:pointer;\n    display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:11px;\n    padding:15px 2px;\n  }\n  .elo-faq__q::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\n\n  .elo-faq__box{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px}\n  .elo-faq__box svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke:var(--elo-text);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;display:block}\n\n  .elo-faq__label{\n    flex:1;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;\n    color:var(--elo-text);letter-spacing:-.01em;padding-top:1px;\n  }\n\n  .elo-faq__chev{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;transition:transform .25s ease}\n  .elo-faq__chev svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:#9A9A94;fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;display:block}\n  .elo-faq__item[open] .elo-faq__chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n\n  .elo-faq__a{\n    padding:0 2px 16px 32px;\n    font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;\n    animation:elo-faq-in .22s ease;\n  }\n  .elo-faq__a p{margin:0}\n  .elo-faq__a p + p{margin-top:8px}\n  .elo-faq__a b{font-weight:700;color:var(--elo-text)}\n  @keyframes elo-faq-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .elo-faq__q{padding:17px 2px;gap:13px}\n    .elo-faq__box svg{width:20px;height:20px}\n    .elo-faq__label{font-size:14.5px}\n    .elo-faq__a{font-size:13.5px;padding-left:34px;padding-bottom:18px}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"elo-faq\" id=\"elo-faq\">\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">¿Cómo elijo mi talla?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>Pide tu <b>talla de siempre</b>. El tejido de compresión progresiva se adapta de forma natural a tu cuerpo. Si dudas entre dos tallas, coge la <b>más grande</b>: la sujeción es la misma y podrás llevarla todo el día sin que te apriete.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">Di a luz hace años, ¿ya es tarde para mí?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>En absoluto. <b>La pared abdominal no caduca.</b> La compresión circular 360° actúa sobre la pared abdominal sin importar el tiempo que haya pasado desde el parto.</p>\n      <p>Ya hayan pasado 3 meses o 10 años, la braguita Elorya acompaña a tu cuerpo para que todo vuelva a su sitio.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">¿Desde cuándo puedo ponérmela después del parto?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>A partir de <b>2 semanas</b> tras un parto vaginal. Si has tenido <b>cesárea, espera 6 semanas</b>.</p>\n      <p>El corte alto de la braguita Elorya está pensado para no ejercer <b>ninguna presión sobre la zona de la cicatriz</b>.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">¿Se nota cuando voy vestida?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>Para nada. La braguita Elorya está hecha con un <b>tejido ultrafino sin costuras visibles</b>. Debajo de un vestido, unos vaqueros o unas mallas, es <b>totalmente indetectable</b>.</p>\n      <p>Llévala de la mañana a la noche sin que nadie se dé cuenta.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">¿En cuánto tiempo se nota la diferencia?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>La sujeción y el <b>efecto alisador se notan desde el primer día</b>, en cuanto te la pones.</p>\n      <p>En cuanto a los resultados duraderos sobre la firmeza de la tripa, la mayoría de nuestras clientas ven un <b>cambio visible a las 2 o 3 semanas</b> de uso diario.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">¿Puedo llevarla después de una cesárea?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>Sí. La braguita Elorya tiene un <b>corte alto</b> que reparte la compresión por toda la tripa, las caderas y la espalda, <b>sin crear ningún punto de presión sobre la cicatriz</b>.</p>\n      <p>Puedes llevarla con total tranquilidad a partir de las <b>6 semanas</b> tras la cesárea.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  {%- comment -%} ⬇️ AJOUT ELORYA — n'existe pas chez eux (objection n°1 en Espagne) {%- endcomment -%}\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">He leído que las fajas debilitan el abdomen. ¿Es verdad?</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>Tienen razón en una cosa: una <b>faja rígida de velcro</b> que te inmoviliza y te aprieta no reeduca nada.</p>\n      <p>Elorya funciona al revés. Es una <b>compresión elástica progresiva</b> que <b>sostiene</b> la pared mientras se cierra, no que la aplasta. Sigues moviéndote, respirando y haciendo tu vida con normalidad.</p>\n      <p>Y sobre todo: <b>no sustituye tu recuperación, la acompaña.</b> Sigue con tu fisioterapeuta de suelo pélvico y respeta los plazos (2 semanas parto vaginal / 6 semanas cesárea).</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"elo-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"elo-faq__q\">\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__box\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\"/><path d=\"M7.5 12.2l3 3 6-6.4\"/></svg></span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__label\">Garantía 30 días — Satisfecha o te devolvemos el dinero</span>\n      <span class=\"elo-faq__chev\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\"/></svg></span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"elo-faq__a\">\n      <p>Estamos tan seguras de nuestra braguita que te damos <b>30 días para probarla</b>.</p>\n      <p>Si no notas ningún cambio, solo tienes que escribirnos un email y te <b>devolvemos el importe íntegro</b>. Sin condiciones. Sin tener que justificar nada.</p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var box = document.getElementById('elo-faq');\n  if(!box) return;\n  var items = box.querySelectorAll('details.elo-faq__item');\n  items.forEach(function(d){\n    d.addEventListener('toggle', function(){\n      if(!d.open) return;\n      items.forEach(function(o){ if(o !== d) o.open = false; });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>"
          }
        },
        "liquid_PHBz4P": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ELORYA — Carrousel vidéos UGC (scroll horizontal, autoplay muet, lazy-load)\n  Ratio des vidéos : change --elo-ratio ci-dessous (3/4 par défaut, 9/16 si portrait plein)\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .elo-ugc{\n    --elo-text:var(--elorya-text,#14140F);\n    --elo-body:var(--elorya-body,#3A3A34);\n    --elo-line:var(--elorya-line,#E6E6E2);\n    --elo-ratio:3/4;\n    font-family:var(--elorya-font,'Montserrat',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif);\n    margin:26px 0;position:relative;\n  }\n  .elo-ugc *{box-sizing:border-box}\n\n  .elo-ugc__title{\n    font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;\n    color:var(--elo-text);text-align:center;margin:0 0 13px;padding:0 6px;\n  }\n\n  .elo-ugc__track{\n    display:flex;gap:9px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\n    scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;\n    padding:2px 14px;margin:0 -14px;\n  }\n  .elo-ugc__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n\n  .elo-ugc__item{\n    flex:0 0 66%;scroll-snap-align:center;\n    border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#EDEBE7;\n    aspect-ratio:var(--elo-ratio);position:relative;\n  }\n  .elo-ugc__item video{\n    width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;\n    background:#EDEBE7;\n  }\n\n  .elo-ugc__nav{\n    display:none;position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);\n    width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--elo-line);\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);cursor:pointer;padding:0;\n    align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:2;\n    box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.10);\n  }\n  .elo-ugc__nav svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke:var(--elo-text);fill:none;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n  .elo-ugc__nav--prev{left:-6px}\n  .elo-ugc__nav--next{right:-6px}\n  .elo-ugc__nav:hover{background:#fff}\n\n  @media (min-width:750px){\n    .elo-ugc__title{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px}\n    .elo-ugc__track{gap:12px;padding:2px 0;margin:0}\n    .elo-ugc__item{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/4)}\n    .elo-ugc__nav{display:flex}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"elo-ugc\" id=\"elo-ugc\">\n\n  <h3 class=\"elo-ugc__title\">Así la llevan ellas</h3>\n\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"elo-ugc__nav elo-ugc__nav--prev\" data-elo-prev aria-label=\"Anterior\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"elo-ugc__nav elo-ugc__nav--next\" data-elo-next aria-label=\"Siguiente\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"elo-ugc__track\" data-elo-track>\n    {%- assign elo_videos = 'fa9a12f3b9f7409a883972d02f87a342,cdb1f46d312c4ca6b38e406d22ba3054,8715f7d6c0cf4f9aa5eab2668a259167,891eb18ff3b44ba0a20a4a21d18130a4,67783d263c014f6783561d45b942badc,fdd37220263949aeb84e64115ffeb693' | split: ',' -%}\n    {%- for v in elo_videos -%}\n      <div class=\"elo-ugc__item\">\n        <video\n          muted\n          loop\n          playsinline\n          webkit-playsinline\n          disablepictureinpicture\n          preload=\"none\"\n          data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/{{ v }}.mp4\"></video>\n      </div>\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var root = document.getElementById('elo-ugc');\n  if(!root) return;\n  var track = root.querySelector('[data-elo-track]');\n  var vids  = root.querySelectorAll('video');\n\n  /* --- Lazy-load + play uniquement ce qui est visible --- */\n  if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){\n      entries.forEach(function(e){\n        var v = e.target;\n        if(e.isIntersecting){\n          if(!v.src && v.dataset.src){ v.src = v.dataset.src; }\n          var p = v.play(); if(p && p.catch) p.catch(function(){});\n        } else {\n          if(!v.paused) v.pause();\n        }\n      });\n    }, { rootMargin:'150px', threshold:0.35 });\n    vids.forEach(function(v){ io.observe(v); });\n  } else {\n    vids.forEach(function(v){ v.src = v.dataset.src; v.play().catch(function(){}); });\n  }\n\n  /* --- Flèches desktop --- */\n  function step(dir){\n    var item = track.querySelector('.elo-ugc__item');\n    if(!item) return;\n    var w = item.getBoundingClientRect().width + 12;\n    track.scrollBy({ left: dir * w, behavior:'smooth' });\n  }\n  var prev = root.querySelector('[data-elo-prev]');\n  var next = root.querySelector('[data-elo-next]');\n  if(prev) prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ step(-1); });\n  if(next) next.addEventListener('click', function(){ step(1); });\n})();\n</script>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_7LqTqm": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "CARE",
            "content": "<ol><li><strong>Wash at 30°C (85°F) in the washing machine or by hand</strong><br/>Use the delicate cycle if machine washing. Unlike drugstore tights that rip if you breathe on them, these are <strong>built to last</strong>—no drama needed.<br/></li><li><strong>Use regular detergent (no bleach, no fabric softener)</strong><br/>A gentle detergent works best, but don't overthink it. Skip bleach and fabric softener—they damage the sculpting fibers, and these are already <strong>luxuriously soft</strong>.<br/></li><li><strong>Lay flat or hang to dry (NEVER use the dryer)</strong><br/>The dryer is your enemy. Just hang them normally or lay flat. Avoid direct sunlight or the shade may fade.<br/></li><li><strong>Fold carefully and store in your drawer</strong><br/>No weird creases or they'll lose shape. Treat them like your favorite piece—no special museum drawer required, just normal care.<br/></li><li><strong>Replace only when necessary</strong><br/>If the control band stops holding as well or the fabric shows wear, time for a new pair. But relax—these <strong>last WAY longer</strong> than those $15 tights that rip after one wear.<br/></li></ol><p>Pro Tip: Buy 2-3 pairs and rotate them throughout the week so they last <strong>twice as long</strong>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_text_7tUrHT": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "Shipping Information",
            "content": "<p><strong>Just placed your order? 🎉 Great choice!</strong></p><p>Our team gets to work immediately to prepare your package with care.</p><p><strong>⏱️ Processing time:</strong> Within 24-48 hours</p><p>Once your order ships, you'll receive <strong>a confirmation email with your tracking number</strong>. With one click, you can follow your package all the way to your doorstep.</p><p>Questions? Our customer support team is available 7 days a week.</p>",
            "page": ""
